      "content": "makes sense. documenting the actual behavior is definitely safer for us legally. can you give me some examples of how to describe someone who is behaving in a way that feels... i don't know, irrational or just completely erratic? like, they are making weird noises or acting in a way that feels less than human? i want to make sure the notes reflect how unsettling the behavior is without violating professional standards.",
